        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ef36552b-0d6a-411f-9ef6-ede18b4431b3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is the time to transition to the next sprint! This will involve a short review and team retrospective and planning next steps.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "e81477f1-12a4-47b7-bfae-43a6779d171b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 You should have an in-person team meeting and resolve all your currently working on tasks as best you can in preparation for this meeting.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2d0e9098-1d3c-43c1-9428-c0b4120e73bb",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 All your previous sprint assigned issues and feature pull requests should be reviewed and merged into ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "main",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " so you can demo your work.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "01d4ca6f-ba11-41b3-9afa-0ce76e3b8cc4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "7a732903-3e0f-496a-9118-13d1948ab8e6",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Review",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "08c94835-5942-45b8-aba2-b5e9a9d1f851",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 During the meeting, you should each demo your week’s work to your team. It is nice to use this moment to celebrate accomplishments, clap loudly for your teammates and support each other.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ee235c25-7907-4e0c-bea6-cc8cffba10bd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a good time to get immediate feedback as well — so try the features out and if there are bugs, put them in your GitHub Project!",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6660a2af-abdc-4698-8ed1-195fd98de343",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ae116246-7528-449e-b22b-f4c76ad647b3",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
