          "type": "text",
          "text": "Retrospective",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "7778d53a-9a8a-435b-8ccb-cf28985a04fe",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 Discuss what is working and what isn’t, and then summarize your meeting notes in the below format.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "3b2e4e08-5a93-436e-9bb9-4a6ef3653961",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 Create a new Issue titled: ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sprint Retrospective Term 1 - Sprint #",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "92a0479a-20ff-4747-b834-16a4ae530ee3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s a template:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "5d8724e9-72ad-4a95-89b7-b1286f52a330",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "markdown"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- members in attendance:\n  ![selfie proof of meeting]()\n  - [x] Jasmine\n  - [ ] Alladin\n- what worked well\n  - we made progress\n  - ![post some progress screenshots]()\n  - etc\n- what didn't\n  - we didn't make much progress\n  - etc\n- self assessment on progress\n  - where are you in relation to progress towards product and milestones?\n  - give an estimate of how far towards your goals you are, do you think you're on track?\n- lay out _each_ of the following weeks till end of term with brief goals for each\n  - current week: goals\n  - week #: goals\n  - week #: goals, etc\n- briefly summarize any other topics/discussions",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "87b55bd2-4bf4-4b57-adbc-857384db5a62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "⚠️ Each week you will create a sprint retro issue that will briefly summarize your sprint retro meeting. This template is just a suggestion.  Mostly we just want you to have gone through your project and kept notes on your meeting. If you prefer a different meeting format - that is totally fine. Just submit your meeting notes for this issue.  The part that is not optional is that you have the meeting. That the meeting is in-person as much as it can be, and that you review each issue on your project board and keep it updated",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8f86e7c6-ca69-434b-ba29-d9d6f89818f3",
      "type": "paragraph",
